<!doctype html><html data-currency-code="USD" data-lang="en" lang="en" prefix="og: https://ogp.me/ns#"><head><title>Superbuy | China Shopping Agent · Parcel Forwarding · Cross-border Solutions</title><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta content="webkit" name="renderer"><meta content="IE=edge" http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible"><link href="https://superbuy.com/" rel="canonical"><meta content="website" property="og:type"><meta content="" property="og:title"><meta content="" property="og:description"><meta content="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/img/favicon/favicon-180x180.png" property="og:image"><meta content="http://www.superbuy.com/" property="og:url"><link href="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/img/favicon/favicon.svg" rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml"><link href="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/img/favicon/favicon-32x32.png" rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32"><link href="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/img/favicon/favicon-96x96.png" rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="96x96"><link href="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/img/favicon/favicon-180x180.png" rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="180x180"><link href="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/img/favicon/favicon-192x192.png" rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="192x192"><link href="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/img/favicon/favicon-228x228.png" rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="228x228"><link href="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/img/favicon/favicon-300x300.png" rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="300x300"><link href="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/img/favicon/favicon-512x512.png" rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="512x512"><base href="/"><link href="//cdn.superbuy.com" rel="dns-prefetch"><link href="//img1.superbuy.com" rel="dns-prefetch"><link href="https://cdn.superbuy.com" rel="preconnect"><link href="https://img.alicdn.com" rel="preconnect"><link href="https://www.echatsoft.com" rel="preconnect"><meta content="code-xzTuzQSrip" name="baidu-site-verification"><meta content="qlxtf81tngibsbd2wurfau5n0qeqoy" name="facebook-domain-verification"><script>if (window.__REACT_DEVTOOLS_GLOBAL_HOOK__) {window.__REACT_DEVTOOLS_GLOBAL_HOOK__.inject = function () {}}</script><link href="//at.alicdn.com/t/c/font_2967298_eqq1bezwvpc.css" rel="stylesheet" data-react-helmet="true"><meta content="Superbuy | China Shopping Agent · Parcel Forwarding · Cross-border Solutions" property="og:title" data-react-helmet="true"><meta content="china shopping proxy, buy from china, buy chinese products, taobao agent, china shopping online, taobao shopping agent, international shipping" name="keywords" data-react-helmet="true"><meta content="Superbuy: Your trusted Taobao/1688/Weidian agent since 2012. Free QC, parcel consolidation, 90-day storage & worldwide shipping via DHL/EMS. Trusted by 2M+ users! Sign up now for CNY560 bonus!" name="description" data-react-helmet="true"><script defer="defer" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/202609/common/manifest.08fa355efb3ce936e2e7.bundle.js"></script><script defer="defer" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/202609/common/chunk-antd.2c955910e01ec14e710d.bundle.js"></script><script defer="defer" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/202609/common/chunk-vendor.1169e6c2c17d0e0cf347.bundle.js"></script><script defer="defer" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/202609/common/guide/feecomposition/trans.282a4d9cc08da3e66e7c.bundle.js"></script><script defer="defer" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/202609/common/chunk-crypto-js.5615ed7eca13affef6a3.bundle.js"></script><script defer="defer" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/202609/common/chunk-common.791bf5c33e707af10973.bundle.js"></script><script defer="defer" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/202609/common/5666.b6ee0f1a60e5149e8ce9.bundle.js"></script><script defer="defer" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/202609/common/4409.5a021c9fbc73865bfb40.bundle.js"></script><script defer="defer" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/202609/common/2257.d6da5b50da6b605b331f.bundle.js"></script><script defer="defer" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/202609/common/3394.84ce9da3aa79aec4c535.bundle.js"></script><script defer="defer" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/202609/common/app.677faf0a7953e4154ba9.bundle.js"></script><script defer="defer" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/202609/common/guide/feecomposition.16d6432085b54b69b526.bundle.js"></script><link href="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/202609/common/chunk-antd.f3322e2a8721abf600c7.css" rel="stylesheet"><link href="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/202609/common/chunk-common.97d95d7a83ddef1d0a81.css" rel="stylesheet"><link href="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/202609/common/5666.e8f1927d25adc2dbcdb3.css" rel="stylesheet"><link href="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/202609/common/app.5f702e16bf512b3ca196.css" rel="stylesheet"><link href="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/202609/common/guide/feecomposition.dae36599bec7e0fad526.css" rel="stylesheet"></head><body><div id="container" data-prerender="true"><div class="m-wrap lang-en"><div class="m-main"><div class="fix-header"><div class=""><div class="m-header m-header-en lang-en header-container-main" id="m-header"><div class="header-top noLogin" data-tag-name="全局顶部导航"><div class="header-center header-top-main clearfix"><div class="fl left-operation" data-tag-name="左侧"><a href="/en/page/homepage" aria-label="header-logo" class="header-logo" title="The best shopping agent help you shop from China"></a></div><section class="search-box prerender"><div class="search-box common-main-search common-search-theme-top image-search type-selector no-login"><div class="search-type-select-container"><div class="search-selector"><div class="selector-active">Product<i class="arrow-icon"></i></div><ul class="search-selector-list"><li><span class="search-selector-text">Shop</span></li></ul></div></div><input placeholder="Product link or keyword" value=""><span class="clear-button"></span><button class="" aria-label="search"></button></div></section><div class="fr right-operation" data-tag-name="右侧"><div class="drop-down global-drop-down" data-tag-name="语言币种切换"><a href="/#" aria-label="drop-down" class="drop-down-top"><div data-tag-name="语言币种切换按钮" translate="no"><div id="google_translate_element" style="display: none;"></div><div class="text">English/</div></div></a><div class="drop-down-bottom"><div translate="no"><dl><dt>Language</dt><dd class=""><div class="common-img-wrap flag-img"><img alt="中文（简体）" class="common-img" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/img/flag/CN.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div><span>中文（简体）</span></dd><dd class="active"><div class="common-img-wrap flag-img"><img alt="English" class="common-img" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/img/flag/US.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div><span>English</span></dd></dl><dl class="currency-section"><dt>Currency</dt><dd class="">CN ￥</dd><dd class="active">US $</dd></dl><button data-tag-name="确定按钮">OK</button></div></div></div><div class="drop-down cart-drop-down" data-tag-name="购物车按钮"><div><a href="/en/page/shoppingcart/" aria-label="drop-down" class="car-drop-dowm"><span class="icon-cart"></span></a></div></div><div class="drop-down special-drop-down query-nav" data-tag-name="工具栏"><a href="/#" aria-label="drop-down" class="drop-down-top"><div class="special-tabs"><i class="icon-car"></i><em class="icon-next"></em></div></a><div class="drop-down-bottom dir-right"><section><ul><li><a href="/en/page/query/freight/" aria-label="account" data-tag-name="Shipping Calculator"><i class="icon-outer"><span class="icon-1-1"></span></i><span>Shipping Calculator</span></a></li><li><a href="/en/page/query/package/" aria-label="account" data-tag-name="Parcel Tracking"><i class="icon-outer"><span class="icon-1-2"></span></i><span>Parcel Tracking</span></a></li><li><a href="/en/page/query/freight/#tabIndex=1" aria-label="account" data-tag-name="Shipping Solution Inquiry"><i class="icon-outer"><span class="icon-1-3"></span></i><span>Shipping Solution Inquiry</span></a></li><li><a href="/en/page/customization/expert-service/?isNeedParams=1" aria-label="account" data-tag-name="Shipping Expert"><i class="icon-outer"><span class="icon-1-4"></span></i><span>Shipping Expert</span></a></li><li><a href="/en/page/customization/fillin/" aria-label="account" data-tag-name="Customized Logistics"><i class="icon-outer"><span class="icon-1-5"></span></i><span>Customized Logistics</span></a></li><li><a href="/en/page/account/consult/before-sale" aria-label="account" data-tag-name="Shopping Enquiry"><i class="icon-outer"><span class="icon-1-6"></span></i><span>Shopping Enquiry</span></a></li></ul></section></div></div><div class="drop-down special-drop-down customer-nav" data-tag-name="帮助栏"><a href="/#" aria-label="drop-down" class="drop-down-top"><div class="special-tabs"><i class="icon-service"></i><em class="icon-next"></em></div></a><div class="drop-down-bottom dir-right"><section><ul><li><a href="/en/page/help/" aria-label="account" data-tag-name="Help Center"><i class="icon-outer"><span class="icon-2-1"></span></i><span>Help Center</span></a></li><li><a href="javascript:void(0);" aria-label="account" data-tag-name="Customer Service"><i class="icon-outer"><span class="icon-2-2"></span></i><span>Customer Service</span></a></li><li><a href="/en/page/shippinghacks/" aria-label="account" data-tag-name="Shipping Hacks"><i class="icon-outer"><span class="icon-2-3"></span></i><span>Shipping Hacks</span></a></li><li><a href="/en/page/noviceguide/" aria-label="account" data-tag-name="User Guidance"><i class="icon-outer"><span class="icon-2-4"></span></i><span>User Guidance</span></a></li><li><a href="/en/page/about/contactus/" aria-label="account" data-tag-name="Contact Us"><i class="icon-outer"><span class="icon-2-5"></span></i><span>Contact Us</span></a></li><li><a href="/en/page/about/aboutus/" aria-label="account" data-tag-name="About Us"><i class="icon-outer"><span class="icon-2-6"></span></i><span>About Us</span></a></li></ul></section></div></div></div></div></div><div class="header-middle"><div class="header-center header-middle-main"><ul class="header-nav"><li class="nav-item home"><a href="/en/page/homepage" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="drop-down" target="_self" class="nav-text">HOME</a></li><li class="nav-item express"><a href="/en/page/transport/" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="drop-down" target="_self" class="nav-text">FORWARDING</a></li><li class="nav-item business"><a href="https://www.buckydrop.com/en/?pr=5XFWE&prc=W2V1V&utm_source=superbuy&utm_medium=referral&utm_content=website-navigation" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="drop-down" target="_blank" class="nav-text">DROPSHIPPING</a></li><li class="nav-item partner"><a href="/en/page/about/affiliate/" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="drop-down" target="_self" class="nav-text">AFFILIATES</a></li><li class="nav-item pricing"><a href="/en/page/guide/feecomposition" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="drop-down" target="_self" class="nav-text">PRICING</a></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ant-spin-nested-loading global-spin"><div class="ant-spin-container"><div class="app-container"><div class="hero-section"><div class="hero-wrap"><div class="hero-content"><div class="hero-text"><h1 class="hero-title">Superbuy Fee Structure</h1><p class="hero-description">The total cost of shopping at Superbuy is transparent and consists of <b>Product Cost, International Shipping Fee, and Value-Added Service Fee</b>. The first two correspond to the two main stages: Stage 1 (Shopping Agent) and Stage 2 (International Shipping). The Value-Added Service Fee is optional based on your personalized needs.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="main-content"><section class="content-section"><div class="section-header"><div class="icon-wrapper icon-wrapper-blue"><svg fill="none" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"></path><polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"></polyline><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="22.08" y2="12"></line></svg></div><div class="title-main"><h2 class="section-title">Stage 1: Purchasing Service Fee</h2><p>(Charged when we buy the item for you domestically.)</p></div></div><p class="section-description">This stage covers all costs incurred to ship the item from the Chinese merchant to the Superbuy warehouse. It consists of three components:</p><div class="fee-card-container"><div class="fee-card fee-goods-platform"><h3 class="fee-card-title">Original Product Price</h3><p class="fee-card-text">The listed price of the item on platforms such as Taobao or JD.com. Superbuy charges no extra fees on this price.</p></div><div class="fee-card fee-goods-platform"><h3 class="fee-card-title">China Domestic Shipping Fee</h3><p class="fee-card-text">The courier fee for shipping from the merchant to the Superbuy warehouse. Superbuy pays this on your behalf without any extra charges (fees vary by merchant; some offer "Free Shipping").</p></div></div><div class="fee-grid-container"><div class="title">Purchasing Service Fee</div><p class="des">This charge represents Superbuy's percentage-based purchasing service fee, calculated on the item cost and determined by its source platform：</p><div class="fee-grid"><div class="fee-card fee-card-beige"><h3 class="fee-card-title">Standard Purchasing Service<span> (Free)</span></h3><p class="fee-card-text">No service fee is charged for mainstream platforms such as Taobao, Tmall, JD.com, and 1688.</p></div><div class="fee-card fee-card-yellow"><h3 class="fee-card-title">Secondhand Item Purchasing Service</h3><div class="fee-card-text"><p>Xianyu, Paipai, Zhuanzhuan, etc.: Flat fee of <b>CN¥ 20/DI.</b></p><p>Kongfz and other second-hand platforms: <b>10%</b> service fee based on item value<b> (Min CN¥ 10, Max CN¥ 20).</b></p><p class="fee-card-note">Note: Rates differ slightly due to the complex communication and after-sales processes involved.</p></div></div><div class="fee-card fee-card-purple"><h3 class="fee-card-title">Other Purchasing Services</h3><p class="fee-card-text">For unlisted platforms, a <b>10%</b> service fee based on item value<b> (Min CN¥ 10, Max CN¥ 20).</b></p></div><div class="fee-card fee-card-gray"><h3 class="fee-card-title">Shipping Expert</h3><p class="fee-card-text">For special items (e.g., pre-sales, limited editions), the "<a href="/en/page/eptpurchase/" target="_blank">Shipping Expert</a>" service applies with a <b>10%</b> service fee based on item value<b> (Min CN¥ 20, Max CN¥ 300).</b></p></div></div></div><div class="example-box"><p class="example-text"><span class="example-label">Fee Calculation Example:</span>To buy a piece of clothing for CN¥ 100 on Taobao with CN¥ 10 domestic shipping and Detailed Photos (CN¥ 3.00):</p><p class="example-formula">Total Stage 1 Cost: CN¥ 100 (Price) + CN¥ 10 (Shipping) + CN¥ 0 (Service Fee) + CN¥ 3.00 (Photos) = CN¥ 113.00</p></div><div class="fee-description"><b>Reminder (Storage Policy):</b>Once the fees for this stage are paid, the item will be sent to the Superbuy warehouse for storage. Items enjoy a 90-day free storage period upon arrival. Items exceeding the free period will be charged a storage fee of CN¥ 0.1 per item per day. The maximum storage period is 180 days. If no parcel shipping order is submitted or no feedback is provided after 180 days, the item will be considered abandoned and disposed of. To extend the storage, please purchase the "Extend Storage Period" service in advance. For more details, please visit the <a href="/en/page/help/#search_helpId1391" target="_blank">Help Center.</a></div></section><section class="content-section big-width"><div class="shipping-formula-section"><div class="section-header"><div class="icon-wrapper icon-wrapper-green"><svg fill="none" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20"><rect height="13" width="15" x="1" y="3"></rect><polygon points="16 8 20 8 23 11 23 16 16 16 16 8"></polygon><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"></circle></svg></div><div class="title-main"><h2 class="section-title">Stage 2: International Shipping Fee</h2><p>(Charged when we ship your parcel overseas to you.)</p></div></div><p class="section-description">This section covers the fees for the second stage. Once items arrive at the warehouse, you need to pay to ship the parcel to your address. This fee is a comprehensive calculation generated by the system based on the final weight of your parcel, the specific shipping line selected, and the destination country/region. If you have purchased multiple items, Superbuy can consolidate them into one parcel for free, which may potentially lower your international shipping costs.</p><div class="shipping-formula-section-content"><h3 class="subsection-title">This fee mainly consists of the following components:</h3><div class="formula-grid"><div class="formula-item"><div class="formula-card"><h4 class="formula-card-title">Initial Weight Shipping Fee</h4><p class="formula-card-text">The starting price for the shipment weight, corresponding to the cost of the first unit of chargeable weight (e.g., 500g)</p></div></div><div class="formula-separator">+</div><div class="formula-item"><div class="formula-card"><h4 class="formula-card-title">Additional Weight Shipping Fee</h4><p class="formula-card-text">The extra fee charged for each additional unit of weight after the parcel exceeds the first weight</p></div></div><div class="formula-separator">+</div><div class="formula-item"><div class="formula-card"><h4 class="formula-card-title">Customs Clearance Fee</h4><p class="formula-card-text">Import taxes (e.g., tariffs, VAT) levied by the destination country's customs based on item category and declared value when the parcel enters the destination country. This fee is borne by the recipient</p></div></div><div class="formula-separator">+</div><div class="formula-item"><div class="formula-card"><h4 class="formula-card-title">Fuel Surcharge</h4><p class="formula-card-text">An additional percentage fee charged on top of the base freight to cope with oil price fluctuations. Most air freight and courier lines charge this fee to hedge against fluctuations in international fuel prices</p></div></div><div class="formula-separator">+</div><div class="formula-item"><div class="formula-card"><h4 class="formula-card-title">Operation Fee</h4><p class="formula-card-text">A base service fee charged by the warehouse for processing your parcel (including storage, sorting, packing, etc.)</p></div></div></div><div class="calculation-example"><p class="example-text"><span class="example-label">Fee Calculation Example:</span>Suppose you choose the "Hong Kong UPS Economy (Tax-Free)" line to ship a 1000g parcel: International Shipping Fee (CN¥ 428) = CN¥ 320 (First Weight 500g) + CN¥ 50 (Continued Weight 500g) + CN¥ 38 (Customs Fee) .</p><div class="calculation-table"><div class="calc-row"><div class="calc-cell"><div class="calc-label">Initial Weight (first 500g):</div><div class="calc-value">CN¥ 320</div></div><div class="calc-cell"><div class="calc-label">Additional Weight (per 500g):</div><div class="calc-value">CN¥ 50</div></div><div class="calc-cell"><div class="calc-label">Customs Clearance Fee</div><div class="calc-value">CN¥ 38</div></div><div class="calc-cell"><div class="calc-label">Fuel Surcharge (%)</div><div class="calc-value">0</div></div><div class="calc-cell"><div class="calc-label">Operation Fee (%)</div><div class="calc-value">0</div></div></div></div><p class="calculation-note">We recommend using the system's <span class="link-text">"Shipping Calculator"</span> feature when submitting your parcel. The system will provide you with the most accurate fee preview based on your parcel's real-time data.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="content-section"><div class="section-header"><div class="icon-wrapper icon-wrapper-orange"><svg fill="none" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20"><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="1" y2="23"></line><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path></svg></div><h2 class="section-title">Value-Added Service Fees</h2></div><p class="section-description">Value-Added Service Fees are incurred for customized services provided to meet your personalized needs and are charged on demand. We offer services such as Professional Photos, Comprehensive Inspection, and Reinforced Packaging to ensure a safer and more worry-free shopping experience. All services are chosen freely by you, and fees are only generated after your confirmation, with no hidden charges.</p><div class="service-grid-5col"><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Switching Packaging" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/Repack.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Switching Packaging">Switching Packaging</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 2.00</span><em>/PCS</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">According to customer requirements, we can remove or replace the product packaging box (bag). The replacement options include Superbuy's own packaging bags, opaque packaging bags, or custom bags or boxes specified by the customer.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Thread Trimming" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/Trim-Threads.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Thread Trimming">Thread Trimming</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 5.00</span><em>/PCS</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">Post-warehouse arrival thread trimming service performed according to customer specifications.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Re-inspection" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/Second-Inspection.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Re-inspection">Re-inspection</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 6.00</span><em>/DI</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">Post-warehouse supplementary or re-inspection service: Verify style, quantity, color, size and model; check for damage and obvious defects; includes 3 actual inspection photos.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Product Label Removal" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/Cut-Label.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Product Label Removal">Product Label Removal</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 3.00</span><em>/PCS</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">Post-warehouse arrival label/tags removal service performed according to customer specifications.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Power-on Inspection for 3C and Appliance" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/Power-OnCheck-en.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Power-on Inspection for 3C and Appliance">Power-on Inspection for 3C and Appliance</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 12.00</span><em>/PCS</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">We will perform a power-on test for the product,checking that the indicator lights and power-on/off function are working normally. One photo providing evidence of the powered-on and operational status will be supplied via internal message and email.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Plastic-Sealing Packaging" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/ShrinkWrap.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Plastic-Sealing Packaging">Plastic-Sealing Packaging</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 10.00</span><em>/PCS</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">Shrink-wrapping the product effectively reduces the risk of moisture damage during international shipping.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Detailed Photo" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/Detailed-Photos.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Detailed Photo">Detailed Photo</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 2.00</span><em>/PCS</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">A personalized high-definition detail photography service where users can select specific angles or details according to their needs. Each photo showcases a single product from a specific angle or detail.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Priority Stock-in" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/PRI-I-En.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Priority Stock-in">Priority Stock-in</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 5.00</span><em>/DI</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">Your item will be stocked in just 3 hours! (Usually takes 24 hours.)</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Speedy Response" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/Fast-Service.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Speedy Response">Speedy Response</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 5.00</span><em>/DO</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">Your order will be processed within 1 hour</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Model Try-on Photos" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/LiveModel-Photos.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Model Try-on Photos">Model Try-on Photos</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 30.00</span><em>/PCS</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">Customers can specify requirements for the model's height, weight, shoe size, etc. Superbuy will arrange a live model who best matches your specified criteria and provide four photos: front, back, left-side, and right-side views. This service includes both clothing fitting and footwear fitting.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Product Video Shooting" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/Product-Video.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Product Video Shooting">Product Video Shooting</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 20.00</span><em>/PCS</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">Providing 360-degree video shooting services for products.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Split Order/Discard Item" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/Split-Order.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Split Order/Discard Item">Split Order/Discard Item</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 2.00</span><em>/DI</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">It refers to a service that allows for the splitting of multiple items within an order into separate orders while the order status is "In Storage," making it easier to submit them for shipping separately. Additionally, it may involve separating certain items within the order, such as free gifts, batteries, or liquids, into different orders or discarding them to reduce the weight of a single order or comply with mailing restrictions.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Extend Storage Period" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/Ext-Storage-Pd.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Extend Storage Period">Extend Storage Period</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 10.00</span><em>/DI/per month</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">Please select the product that needs “Storage Period Extension” , and the length of extension (calculated by month, with a maximum of 6 months for individual product).The service of “Storage Period Extension” only extends the maximum storage period of the product. The storage fee will be charged by day after the free storage ends, and you shall pay it when submitting the parcel for shipment.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Bubble Cushioning Wrap Packaging " class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/Air-Column-PackAir-Column-Pack.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Bubble Cushioning Wrap Packaging ">Bubble Cushioning Wrap Packaging</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 5.00</span><em>/PCS</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">Using bubble cushioning wrap to package products provides effective shock protection, preventing damage caused by compression, collision, and dropping.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Kraft Bubble Mailer Packaging" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/Kraft-Bubble-Mailer.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Kraft Bubble Mailer Packaging">Kraft Bubble Mailer Packaging</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 3.00</span><em>/PCS</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">Using kraft paper bubble mailers for packaging provides cushioning and shock absorption, preventing damage to products due to compression, impact, or drops.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="EPE Packaging" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/EPE-Wrap.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="EPE Packaging">EPE Packaging</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 4.00</span><em>/PCS</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">The product is wrapped in three layers of pearl cotton for cushioning and shock resistance, preventing damage from compression, collision, and dropping.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Customized EPE Packaging" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/CustomEPE-Reinforcement.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Customized EPE Packaging">Customized EPE Packaging</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 23.00</span><em>/PCS</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">Using EPE pearl cotton material for product reinforcement packaging, providing shock resistance, collision protection, and scratch prevention.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Dust Bag Packaging" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/Dust-Bag.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Dust Bag Packaging">Dust Bag Packaging</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 4.00</span><em>/PCS</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">Use dustproof bags to package products, providing protection against dust, scratches, moisture, and prolonged exposure to sunlight that may cause discoloration.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Detailed Inspection" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/Stretch-Film.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Detailed Inspection">Detailed Inspection</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 5.50</span><em>/Item</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">Based on standard inspection, we offer more detailed inspection services, including thorough checks of linings, zippers, pockets, and other areas. We also conduct meticulous examinations for minor stains, discoloration, scratches, snags, and other defects.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Ironing" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/Iron.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Ironing">Ironing</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 20.00</span><em>/PCS</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">【Ironing】The service refers that wrinkled clothing items which stored in the warehouse can be ironed and smoothed according to the customer's requirements. Timeliness and Notification: It will be completed within 24 hours, after which you will be notified the results via message and email.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="EPE Loose Filling" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/EPE-Foam.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="EPE Loose Filling">EPE Loose Filling</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 3.00</span><em>/KG</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">It is a service that uses foam boards to fill and protect the space within the package, greatly minimizing damage to products caused by bumps and jolts. This service is suitable for small appliances, fragile items, and similar products, and works even better when combined with paper corner protection strips.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Corner Protector" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/CornerGuard.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Corner Protector">Corner Protector</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 5.00</span><em>/KG</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">It is a service that adds four corner protection strips to the edges of the cardboard package, commonly used for items that have specific requirements for their original packaging, such as figurine packaging. This ensures sharp corners and is essential for box control.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Stretch Film" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/Stretch-Wrap.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Stretch Film">Stretch Film</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 4.00</span><em>/KG</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">It is a service that provides full coverage of the outer surface of the cardboard package with stretch film to prevent the package from getting wet and being tampered with.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Wooden Case" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/Strengthened-Crate.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Wooden Case">Wooden Case</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 250.00</span><em>/PCS</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">It is a service that uses non-fumigated plywood for comprehensive reinforcement of the package, allowing for direct export. The wooden box features a snap-fit design, making installation and disassembly easy. This packaging provides strong protection against compression and collision during the transportation of high-value, overweight electronic products, electrical equipment, and ceramic crafts. It is recommended to use it in conjunction with EPE foam filler for added protection.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Moister-Barrier Bag" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/Damp-Bag.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Moister-Barrier Bag">Moister-Barrier Bag</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 6.00</span><em>/PCS</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">It is a service that involves adding moisture-proof bags made of thick PE material to the outer surface of the cardboard box and sealing them properly. This effectively prevents the package from getting damp due to weather conditions and protects the internal items from mold during transportation.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Whole-Process Packing Video" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/Packaging-Process.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Whole-Process Packing Video">Whole-Process Packing Video</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 5.00</span><em>/PCS</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">It is a service that provides a complete packaging video of the current package, allowing you to have a more intuitive understanding of the entire packing process. After the service is completed, you can view the packing video on my package page within 30 minutes. We will retain this video for 30 days. If you are unable to view the video after 24 hours, please contact online customer service for assistance.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Customized Packaging" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/Customization.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Customized Packaging">Customized Packaging</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 5.00</span><em>/PCS</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">It is a service where users can request the use of their custom logo, cardboard boxes, packaging bags, and greeting cards, among other items. Please specify the details in the remarks section of the package.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Brand Tag Removal" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/Remove-TagRemove-Tag.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Brand Tag Removal">Brand Tag Removal</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 0.00</span><em>/PCS</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">A tag is a label hung on various types of clothing, containing information such as the material of the garment, washing precautions, brand logo, and price marks. This service reduces the tax risk to a certain extent, but it does not affect the appearance and may result in the goods not being eligible for return or exchange services.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Package Removal" class="common-img" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/media/value-added/s1005.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Package Removal">Package Removal</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 0.00</span><em>/PCS</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">This service will remove excess outer packaging from the products according to Superbuy`s packaging standards to reduce weight and save on shipping costs. After removing packaging boxes (or bags) that may affect the protection of the item, the products will be repackaged. Necessary original protective packaging will still be retained, depending on the specific circumstances.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Simple Packaging" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/Plain-PackagingPlain-Packaging.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Simple Packaging">Simple Packaging</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 0.00</span><em>/PCS</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">It refers to a packaging method that maximizes the reduction of package weight for non-fragile and non-bendable items. This packaging method uses lightweight black stretch film or plastic bags to wrap the products. If you choose this service, we will prioritize bagged packing, with the actual type of packaging (bag or box) determined based on the specific characteristics of the item.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Vacuum Packaging" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/Vacuum-Bag.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Vacuum Packaging">Vacuum Packaging</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 17.00</span><em>/PCS</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">It is a service that uses vacuum compression bags to compress all items within the package into one concentrated vacuum-sealed form, with a maximum bag volume of 100cm x 80cm. This significantly reduces the volume, saving on shipping costs based on volume weight.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Priority Stock-out" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/PRI-O-en.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Priority Stock-out">Priority Stock-out</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 10.00</span><em>/PCS</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">It means that the package will be packed and weighed within three hours after the approval of the review.</p></div></div><div class="service-card"><div class="service-image"><div class="common-img-wrap"><img alt="Folding Shoe Box" class="common-img" src="https://img1.superbuy.com/p/Value_added_Services/img/Portfolio/FoldShoe-Box.png" draggable="false" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="opacity: 1;"></div></div><div class="service-info"><p class="service-name" title="Folding Shoe Box">Folding Shoe Box</p><div class="service-price"><span>CN ￥ 5.00</span><em>/PCS</em></div><p class="service-description" aria-expanded="false">It is a service that involves folding shoe boxes, which can save space and reduce shipping costs based on volume weight. Please note that this service may result in creases on the shoe boxes.</p></div></div></div><p class="service-footer-text">The above is a brief introduction and pricing for all value-added services. For more detailed descriptions and information on our services, please visit the <span class="link-text">Help Center.</span></p></section><section class="content-section"><div class="section-header"><div class="icon-wrapper icon-wrapper-gray"><svg fill="none" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="17" y2="17"></line></svg></div><h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) - Fees & Pricing</h2></div><div class="faq-container"><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question"><span class="faq-question-text">Is Superbuy's pricing transparent? Are there hidden fees?</span><svg fill="none" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" class="faq-icon faq-icon-rotated"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></button><div class="faq-answer faq-answer-open"><div class="faq-answer-content">Superbuy's pricing is completely transparent; all fees will be clearly displayed before you place an order. There are no hidden fees, so you can use our services with confidence.</div></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question"><span class="faq-question-text">Q: How are your service fees charged, and is basic procurement free of charge?</span><svg fill="none" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" class="faq-icon faq-icon-rotated"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></button><div class="faq-answer faq-answer-open"><div class="faq-answer-content">The shopping agent service fee is charged based on the product's source platform. Ordinary shopping agent service does not charge a service fee.</div></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question"><span class="faq-question-text">Are value-added services mandatory? What value-added services are available?</span><svg fill="none" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" class="faq-icon faq-icon-rotated"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></button><div class="faq-answer faq-answer-open"><div class="faq-answer-content">Value-added services are completely optional; you can choose them according to your needs. We offer various value-added services, including inspection, insurance, reinforced packaging, etc.</div></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question"><span class="faq-question-text">How do I check my order fee details?</span><svg fill="none" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" class="faq-icon faq-icon-rotated"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></button><div class="faq-answer faq-answer-open"><div class="faq-answer-content">You can view the complete fee breakdown on the order details page, including product price, service fees, shipping fees, and all other fee items.</div></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question"><span class="faq-question-text">When is the international shipping fee charged?</span><svg fill="none" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" class="faq-icon faq-icon-rotated"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></button><div class="faq-answer faq-answer-open"><div class="faq-answer-content">The international shipping fee is charged upfront when you submit your shipping order. The system will calculate and collect the payment based on the estimated weight of your parcel, your selected shipping route, and the destination address.Please note that the "estimated weight" is for preliminary calculation only. The final shipping cost will be determined by the logistics provider's official bill. We will then reconcile the charges and issue a refund for any overpayment or collect the balance for any underpayment.<a class="faq-more-link">More ></a></div></div></div></div></section></div></div></div></div></div><div><aside class="m-tool-bar m-tool-bar-en tool-bar-show"><section class="beijing-time-bar"><p>UTC+8</p><p class="">Mar 3rd</p><p class="cur-time" translate="no">17:09:35</p></section><ul><li id="discord" translate="no"><a href="" aria-label="discord" target="_blank"><i class="font-icon"></i></a></li><li class="" id="tool-bar-QRCode"><a href="/en/page/download" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="QRCode" target="_blank"><i class="tool-bar-icon tool-bar-icon-app"></i><div class="sub-text"><img alt="QRCode" class="qr-code" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/wrapper/toolbar/QRCode_en.png"><p class="download-text">Download APP</p><div class="QRCode-bottom"><span>Collect CN￥ 560 New User Gift</span></div></div></a></li><li id="tool-bar-shop-cart"><a href="javascript:void(0);" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="shop cart"><i class="tool-bar-icon tool-bar-icon-shop-cart"></i><div class="sub-text"></div></a></li><li class="service-button"><a href="javascript:void(0);" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="bar-service"><i class="tool-bar-icon-online tool-bar-icon"></i><div class="tool-bar-text">Customer Service</div></a></li><li id="tool-bar-assistant"><div><i class="tool-bar-icon tool-bar-icon-tools"></i><div class="sub-text"><div class="tools-container"><div class="title">Shopping Assistant</div><a href="/#" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="bar-shopping-tools">Shipping Calculator<spa